    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9677" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντεπι-δείκνῡμι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exhibit in turn,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				162b
			</span></i>: c. part., <i>contrast,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἑαυτὸν ποιοῦντά τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Ages.</u>
					1.12
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <i>exhibit oneself in competition,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.674b
			</span></i>: also c. acc. rei, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι καλόν τινι</span>
			<i>display a</i> fine <i>sight in rivalry with,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				23
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τι πρός τι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					21
				</span></i>
			.</div>
